{"id":"nord","lemma":"nord","pos":"noun","rank":812,"glosses":["north"],"ipa":"/nɔʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d0/Fr-nord.ogg/Fr-nord.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","examples":[{"text":"Le vent souffle du nord.","en":"The wind is blowing from the north.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"wind"},{"g":"blowing"},{"g":"of the / some"},null]},{"text":"L'hiver est froid dans le nord.","en":"Winter in the north is cold.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"winter"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"cold"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Au nord, il fait froid en hiver.","en":"In the north, it's cold in the winter.","words":[{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"cold"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"winter"}]},{"text":"Ma maison est au nord de la bibliothèque.","en":"My house is north of the library.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mon"},{"g":"house, home"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to the"},null,null,null,{"g":"library"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"of the"]]},{"text":"Nous sommes partis plein nord.","en":"We went due north.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"to go away","l":"partir"},{"g":"full, full up"},null]}]}